+        f"p = {p}",
+        f"number of groups g = {inst['groups']}",
+        "The constraint graph on the groups is given by directed records",
+        "i j a b c d.  Such a record permits exactly the pairs (t_i,t_j)",
+        "satisfying t_j=M(t_i), where M=[[a,b],[c,d]].",
